        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 4010/400-US32D 12\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Stainless Steel Door Pull has 12\" center to center mounting points with a total length of 13-1/4\". It is most often used on commercial doors such as store and restaurant doors. It has a satin stainless steel finish for a modern look. It available with thrubolt mounting or back to back mounting (requires 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-stainless-steel-door-pull-omnia-4010-300-us32d\"><b>8\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/16-inch-stainless-steel-door-pull-omnia-4010-500-us32d\"><b>16\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 4010/400-US32D Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" (400 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-pull-mounting-btb.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Pull Back to Back Mounting Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<BR><BR>\r\n<p><B>***THIS ITEM IS DISCONTINUED, LIMITED STOCK AVAILABLE***</b></p>\r\n<BR><BR>",
